    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Interim Dean of the Aga Khan University's Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC), Prof. Nancy Booker, was a jury member for Konrad Adenur Stiftung (KAS) Media Africa's inaugural Award for Local Journalism, held on January 31 st  2023 in Windhoek, Namibia. The aim of the awards was to recognize significant local journalism that is presented with a high journalistic standard.",
